---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Impact Methodology — Kokonut Foundation" description="How impact is measured.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-strong">Impact Methodology</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Every metric should answer: who produced this data, when, how, using what methodology, for which project, what evidence supports it, has it been reviewed, verified, attested.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-muted">
      <p>Metrics are recorded in D1 with verification status: reported → reviewed → verified → attested.</p>
      <p>Evidence files live in R2 and link to metrics and projects.</p>
      <p>Methodologies are documented per metric and per report.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
